codex
The loop invariant will summarize “append the transformed line for each remaining string” with an accumulator-recursive function. This form mirrors the actual `append` updates exactly, so the inductive step does not need an unproved list-concatenation axiom. I’m also making the loop-local names explicit before the loop; that gives the circularity a stable, exact frame shape without changing the function’s behavior.
